    "animationStyle": "Hard cuts, text dropping on the voice's rhythm",
    "coverText": "Votes can't buy this"
  },
  "script": "Hot take, launch leaderboards are a popularity contest. Whoever brings the most votes on day one wins. That tells you who has the biggest audience, not which app is good. So we built the opposite of that. Tryworthy ranks every new launch by what people did with it this week. Saves, perk claims and feedback from verified accounts. Each person counts once, and makers' own activity doesn't count. Nobody can pay to rank higher. Join the waitlist, link in bio.",
